us\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/e5b5e93ee27e593639f432d24db7c25d.poster.avif?t=1754566583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/e5b5e93ee27e593639f432d24db7c25d.webm?t=1754566583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to dress them up in a fancy little top hat as well, or make some wacky outfits! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/a71a2b9a86f6297c6fc14e155ddf3dea.avif?t=1754566583\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk through a cute little town to buy accessories for your Bobos to wear, register a new Bobo, visit the doctor, drop them off at camp, purchase snacks for your Bobo to eat, or even adopt a Bobo from the shelter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/52de0b247c0cfdba5453ad2e523b535e.poster.avif?t=1754566583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/52de0b247c0cfdba5453ad2e523b535e.webm?t=1754566583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Watch out for the alley at night...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/0397a5feb611bdc42e0bc77b5f93e069.avif?t=1754566583\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All competitions have scheduled dates they will be held. Check the competition calendar on the Competition Center\u00a0<strong>Jumbotron</strong> to sign up for any competitions that seem tempting! Some competitions will take place every day and night, while others might only happen once a week. Plan ahead and make sure your Bobos are ready to eradicate the competition when the time comes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It will always be worth checking out each area every day and night. You wouldn't want to miss how rowdy the town gets when celebrating World Day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/b48aeaae3877af92dd9c11ffbc19430d.poster.avif?t=1754566583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889810/extras/b48aeaae3877af92dd9c11ffbc19430d.webm?t=1754566583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+lots more things that I will wait to announce later when I am positive that said feature will actually make it into the game so people can't screenshot this and send it to me after I decide to cut the feature since it was a bad idea to begin with.</p>",
